  (text "Internally compensated; C20 feed-forward across R12. EN/UV from the 12 V stage's PGOOD, so 5 V starts after 12 V is good."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 26.67 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.6 1.6)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "576719b7-7ff3-5fd5-875c-4471f9f9b52d")
  )
  (text "C15 and C16 go one at each VIN pin (4 and 13), as close as possible: they carry the switching current."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 29.97 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.6 1.6)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "b8a15ab7-c06c-544c-93ef-4a51d979eae4")
  )
  (text "GND pins 6, 7, 10, 11, 18 and SYNC/MODE (pulse-skipping off: forced continuous at light load is not needed here)."
